Apparent FOV Layout
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   This section provides a diagram illustrating the LICIA LEIA and LUKE
   apparent FOV layout in the corresponding reference frames.
    

   LICIA_LEIA
                                  ^
                                  |  direction of 
                                  |    flight
                                  |


                                  ^ +Xpl1 (down-track)
                                  | 
                      Pixel       |
       ---            (1,1)-------|---------+
        ^               |         |         |
        | 2.93 deg      |         |         |
        |  (LEIA)       |         |         |
        |               |         |         |
        |         2048  |         x-------------> +Ypl1 (cross-track)
        |         lines |       +Zpl1       |     
        |               |                   |
        |               |                   |
        V               |                   |
       ---              +-------------------+
                          2048 pixels/line

                        |  2.93 deg (LEIA)  |      Boresight (+Z axis)
                        |<----------------->|       is into the page
                        |                   |


   LICIA_LUKE

                                  ^
                                  |  direction of 
                                  |    flight
                                  |


                                  ^ +Xpl2 (down-track)
                                  | 
                      Pixel       |
       ---            (1,1)-------|---------+
        ^               |         |         |
        | 4.8 deg       |         |         |
        |  (LUKE)       |         |         |
        |               |         |         |
        |         1088  |         x-------------> +Ypl2 (cross-track)
        |         lines |       +Zpl2       |     
        |               |                   |
        |               |                   |
        V               |                   |
       ---              +-------------------+
                          2048 pixels/line

                        |  9.15 deg (LUKE)  |      Boresight (+Z axis)
                        |<----------------->|       is into the page
                        |                   |


Optical Parameters
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   The following LICIA LEIA and LUKE nominal first order optical
   parameters are included in the data section below, from [3]:

      ----------------------------------------------------------------
             parameter                    LEIA                 LUKE     
      ----------------------------------------------------------------
      Focal Length, mm                    222.5                70.5   
      f/ratio                             f/3                 f/2.2   
      IFOV, rad/pixel                     0.000025            0.000078
      Field of view (deg)
          Cross-track                     2.93                9.15    
          Along-track                     2.93                4.86    
      ----------------------------------------------------------------

   The keywords below provide nominal data both cameras. Angular size
   values in the keywords are given radians, with the cross-track size
   being the first value and the along-track size being the second
   value in each pair.

      \begindata

         INS-210100_FOCAL_LENGTH       = ( 222.5                )
         INS-210100_F/RATIO            = (   3.0                )
         INS-210100_FOV_ANGULAR_SIZE   = (   0.0516, 0.0516     )
         INS-210100_IFOV               = (   0.000025           )
 
         INS-210200_FOCAL_LENGTH       = (  70.5                )
         INS-210200_F/RATIO            = (   2.2                )
         INS-210200_FOV_ANGULAR_SIZE   = (   0.1597, 0.0848     )
         INS-210200_IFOV               = (   0.000078           )
 
     \begintext
     
     
CCD Parameters
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   The LICIA LEIA and LICIA LUKE use the CMOS detector with the following
   nominal geometry parameters, from [3]:

      -------------------------------------------------------
             parameter                     LEIA        LUKE
      -------------------------------------------------------
      Pixel Size, microns
          Cross-track                      5.5        5.5
          Along-track                      5.5        5.5   
      Detector Array Size
          Cross-track                      2048       2048  
          Along-track                      2048       1088  
      Detector Array Center
          Cross-track                      1023.5     1023.5
          Along-track                      1023.5     0543.5
      ------------------------------------------------------

   The values are given in microns for PIXEL_SIZE keywords and in counts
   for PIXEL_SAMPLES, PIXEL_LINES, and CENTER keywords.

      \begindata

         INS-210100_PIXEL_SIZE         = ( 5.5, 5.5       )
         INS-210100_PIXEL_SAMPLES      = ( 2048           )
         INS-210100_PIXEL_LINES        = ( 2048           )
         INS-210100_CCD_CENTER         = ( 1023.5, 1023.5 )

         INS-210200_PIXEL_SIZE         = ( 5.5, 5.5       )
         INS-210200_PIXEL_SAMPLES      = ( 2048           )
         INS-210200_PIXEL_LINES        = ( 1088           )
         INS-210200_CCD_CENTER         = ( 1023.5, 543.5  )

      \begintext
      
      
FOV Definitions
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

   This section contains definitions for the LICIA LEIA FOV.
   These definitions are provided in the format required by the SPICE
   (CSPICE) function GETFOV (getfov_c).
   
   
LICIA_LEIA and LICIA_LUKE FOV
-----------------------------------------------------------

   The set of assignments in the data section below defines the LICIA_LEIA and
   LICIA_LUKE with respect to the LICIA_LEIA and LICIA_LEIA frames to be a 
   rectangle with the corners defined by the first and last pixels of the 
   first and last lines of the CCD and the boresight along the +Z axis of 
   the LICIA_LEIA and LICIA_LUKE frames. This FOV definition uses angular 
   extent style specification with the cross and along track angular sizes 
   taken from the ``Optics Parameters'' section above.

   \begindata

        INS-210100_FOV_FRAME          = 'LICIA_LEIA'
        INS-210100_FOV_SHAPE          = 'RECTANGLE'
        INS-210100_BORESIGHT          = ( 0.0,   0.0,  1.0   )
        INS-210100_FOV_CLASS_SPEC     = 'ANGLES'
        INS-210100_FOV_REF_VECTOR     = ( 0.0,   1.0   0.0   )
        INS-210100_FOV_REF_ANGLE      = ( 1.465              )
        INS-210100_FOV_CROSS_ANGLE    = ( 1.465              )
        INS-210100_FOV_ANGLE_UNITS    = 'DEGREES'

        INS-210200_FOV_FRAME          = 'LICIA_LUKE'
        INS-210200_FOV_SHAPE          = 'RECTANGLE'
        INS-210200_BORESIGHT          = ( 0.0,   0.0,  1.0   )
        INS-210200_FOV_CLASS_SPEC     = 'ANGLES'
        INS-210200_FOV_REF_VECTOR     = ( 0.0,   1.0   0.0   )
        INS-210200_FOV_REF_ANGLE      = ( 2.43               )
        INS-210200_FOV_CROSS_ANGLE    = ( 4.575              )
        INS-210200_FOV_ANGLE_UNITS    = 'DEGREES'

   \begintext


